flowchart TD
  A[Open app] --> B[Select role: installer or surveyor]
  B --> C[Enter customer postcode]
  C --> D{Valid postcode?}
  D -- No --> E[Show inline error] --> C
  D -- Yes --> F[Find covering teams, rank by drive time]
  F --> G{Any teams found?}
  G -- No --> H[No coverage state, show nearest anyway]
  G -- Yes --> I[Ranked list and map]
  I --> J[Pick top team]
  J --> K[Check TeamUp]
  K --> L{Team available?}
  L -- No --> M[Try next team] --> J
  L -- Yes --> N[Book the job]
